  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: The vacuum will give. Quark fields always form in pairs, one for each flavour
      you harvest. Open the Build menu and place a Quark Field Pair on two empty
      tiles.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Choose the spot well. Every field you place costs ten times the one before
      it.
